{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The dense index of this component type."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/component\/componentindex-5oxlf"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"componentIndex"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Storages address their per-type state and the per-entity component bitset by this value."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default implementation assigns indices lazily: the first access of a type takes the next free index"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the process, later accesses look it up in a thread-safe table. The index is process-wide, not per "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so all nexuses of a process agree on it. Indices are dense ("},{"code":"0 ..< n","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"code":"n","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" types used so far) and unbounded."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They depend on the order of first use and are not stable between process launches;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/stableIdentifier","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for persistent data."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift has no stored static properties in generic types, so a plain conformance can not cache its index in a static."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provide your own implementation (the "},{"code":"@Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" macro will) as a stored "},{"code":"static let","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for a plain load,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but only if you can guarantee that two types never share an index and that it is in "},{"code":"0 ..< 1_048_576","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Indices are process-wide: a hand-assigned index must not collide with a lazily assigned one of another type."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A collision or an index out of range traps at first use of the type in a nexus."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(1)","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Complexity"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentPAAE14componentIndexSivpZ","symbolKind":"property","extendedModule":"FirebladeECS","roleHeading":"Type Property","title":"componentIndex","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"componentIndex"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component\/componentIndex-5oxlf"},"sections":[],"kind":"s